{"id":"f93e27fe7f2babaf","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-normal-system.md","title":"Normal System","display":"df-normal-system — Normal System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-normal-system","aliases":["90-df-normal-system"],"display":"df-normal-system — Normal System","depends_on":["[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-strong-representation]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-normal-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-normal-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-system — Normal System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> 是固定有效算术语法环境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>，实际证明码和已选定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{StrongRep},\\mathrm{Represents},\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{StrongRep},\\mathrm{Represents},\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\)</span> 均取元数据所列定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta\">\\(\\vartheta\\)</span> 在下式局部量化，不作为隐藏的环境变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\land\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vartheta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\ \\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\land\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vartheta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\ \\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}\\)</span> 以及内部统一存在唯一的强表示要求，不因较强或不常见而改成逐数函数表示。修复原断言未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span>。解码器在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 中作为存在见证，且在编码值域内由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 唯一确定；实际证明呈示在证明谓词文件中固定。此正规性不单独蕴含一致性、不完备性，也不无条件声称初等字系统是它的子类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-strong-representation","status":"resolved","id":"cc78339b84b14c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[